<Layout title="Be part of the Guild"><section class="wrap page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">FOR ART & THE COMMUNITY SINCE 1979</p><h1>A shared love of art.<br/><em>A place to belong.</em></h1><p class="lede">The Guild encourages artists and people who love art through education, fellowship, exhibitions and charitable work that benefits Harwich residents.</p></section><section class="intro-band"><div class="wrap"><p>Rooted in Harwich.<br/><em>Open to the Cape.</em></p><span>Established in 1979, the Guild is a nonprofit arts organization connecting established and emerging artists across Cape Cod.</span></div></section><section class="wrap section detail-grid" id="membership"><div><p class="eyebrow">BECOME A MEMBER</p><h2>Bring your curiosity.<br/>Find your community.</h2><p>Membership welcomes Cape Cod residents. The Guild’s contact page also lists Barnstable County taxpayers as eligible. Get in touch to confirm current eligibility, dues and the right membership for you.</p><a class="button" href="mailto:info@guildofharwichartists.org">Ask about membership <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="resource-card"><h3>Ready to take the next step?</h3><p>Submit the Guild application in person at the gallery or mail it to the Guild. Gallery membership has a separate application.</p><a href="https://guildofharwichartists.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/Guild-Membership-Application-Form-2022.pdf">Guild membership application (PDF) ↗</a><a href="https://guildofharwichartists.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Gallery-Membership-Application.pdf">Gallery membership application (PDF) ↗</a><p class="note">These are the forms currently linked on the public website; confirm requirements with the Guild.</p><p>Guild of Harwich Artists, Inc.<br/>P.O. Box 382<br/>Harwich Port, MA 02646</p></div></section></Layout>
